plex next to the high school.","source_url":"https://saintpetermn.gov/parks","source_title":"Parks | Saint Peter, MN","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":44.338,"longitude":-93.9438,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"School and scheduled-sports use may affect facility availability; standard city-park rules apply.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"gac-035","buckets":["college-blocks-off-campus"],"subject_name":"North Sunrise Drive at Gault Park","subject_type":"street_or_district","supported_claim":"The City locates Gault Park at 1901 North Sunrise Drive and identifies it as an outdoor sports complex and neighborhood park.","source_url":"https://saintpetermn.gov/parks","source_title":"Parks | Saint Peter, MN","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":44.3435,"longitude":-93.9702,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This is north of campus; city-park hours and scheduled-field restrictions apply.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"gac-036","buckets":["college-blocks-off-campus"],"subject_name":"Highway 169 Seven Mile Creek corridor","subject_type":"street_or_district","supported_claim":"Nicollet County locates Seven Mile Creek Park off Highway 169 between Saint Peter and North Mankato.","source_url":"https://www.co.nicollet.mn.us/349/Parks-Trails","source_title":"Parks & Trails | Nicollet County, MN","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-12","latitude":44.2189,"longitude":-94.0245,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This destination is outside walkable campus blocks and requires suitable transportation; park access is sunrise to sunset.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"evidence_id":"gac-037","buckets":["college-only-happens-here"],"subject_name":"Painting the Rock","subject_type":"tradition","supported_claim":"The College documents painting the rock in front of