{"complete":true,"school_name":"Gustavus Adolphus College","town_name":"Saint Peter","template_id":"college-only-happens-here","title":"Only Happens Here: 10 Traditions That Make No Sense Anywhere Else","description":"From Swedish candle crowns to an authorized Nobel gathering, these documented Gustavus rituals turn heritage, inquiry, remembrance, and celebration into recurring campus practices.","icon":"fingerprint","cards":[{"subject_id":"st-lucia-festival","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"St. Lucia Festival","title":"Candlelight and Swedish Song","subtitle":"A December celebration rooted in the College’s Swedish heritage","notes":"Check the December calendar before attending; the annual program and any participation or admission arrangements can change by year.","short_summary":"The festival brings the Swedish Lucia observance to Gustavus through a named, recurring campus celebration.","evidence_claim":"Gustavus identifies the St. Lucia Festival as a December tradition connected to the College’s founding by Swedish immigrants.","source_url":"https://gustavus.edu/about/administrative-offices/chaplains","source_title":"Chaplains | Gustavus Adolphus College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This is a December event; consult the applicable year’s program for schedule and attendance details.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"christmas-in-christ-chapel","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Christmas in Christ Chapel","title":"The Chapel Becomes the Stage","subtitle":"Choirs, handbells, orchestra, and dance anchor an annual production","notes":"Review the current production page before planning a visit; performance times, viewing options, and admission arrangements vary.","short_summary":"Gustavus ensembles collaborate on a large-scale seasonal program inside Christ Chapel.","evidence_claim":"The College describes Christmas in Christ Chapel as an annual tradition featuring choirs, handbells, orchestra, and selected dancers.","source_url":"https://gustavus.edu/about/administrative-offices/chaplains","source_title":"Chaplains | Gustavus Adolphus College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use the current event listing to confirm performance dates, viewing formats, and admission arrangements.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"service-of-remembrance","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Service of Remembrance","title":"Homecoming Pauses to Remember","subtitle":"Alumni and current singers honor community members who died","notes":"Approach this Homecoming service as a memorial, check the published schedule, and use the livestream when in-person attendance is impractical.","short_summary":"A reflective service interrupts Homecoming festivities to name loss and gather the Gustavus community.","evidence_claim":"Gustavus calls the Service of Remembrance a time-honored Homecoming tradition honoring community members who died since the previous Homecoming.","source_url":"https://gustavus.edu/about/administrative-offices/advancement/alumni/gather-alumni/homecoming-alumni","source_title":"Homecoming – Alumni | Gustavus Adolphus College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The service is tied to Homecoming and is livestreamed; consult the current Homecoming schedule.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"three-crowns-heritage-symbol","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Three Crowns heritage symbol","title":"Three Crowns, Several Origin Stories","subtitle":"A Swedish heritage emblem whose deeper history remains debated","notes":"Look for the three-crown emblem across Gustav